+11. PROHIBITED ACTIVITIES, CANNABIS AND WEAPONS
+• Prohibited at the hotel: prostitution and any paid sexual service, including receiving clients; selling or passing on any substance; fireworks, flammables, gas, candles and incense inside the hotel.
